{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.097, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 24, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:53.128Z", "t_ms": 6955, "delta": "To generate global sensemaking questions for evaluation, GraphRAG employs an adaptive benchmarking approach using a large"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.207, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 25, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:53.333Z", "t_ms": 7159, "delta": " language model (LLM) rather than generating questions directly from the corpus text [C2, C4]. \n\nThe"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.365, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 26, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:53.492Z", "t_ms": 7318, "delta": " process follows a three-step prompting procedure based on a high-level description of the corpus and its intended purposes [C2]:"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.628, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 27, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:53.754Z", "t_ms": 7580, "delta": "\n\n1. **User Personas:** Based on the corpus description, the LLM is prompted to generate personas for $K$ potential"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 7.849, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 28, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:53.975Z", "t_ms": 7801, "delta": " hypothetical users of the RAG system to reflect realistic use cases [C2, C4].\n2. **Tasks:** For each generated"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.038, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 29, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:54.163Z", "t_ms": 7989, "delta": " user persona, the LLM is prompted to define $N$ relevant tasks that the user would seek to accomplish using the RAG system ["}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.212, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 30, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:54.338Z", "t_ms": 8164, "delta": "C2].\n3. **Global Questions:** For each (user, task) combination, the LLM is prompted"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.358, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 31, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:54.483Z", "t_ms": 8310, "delta": " to generate $M$ high-level questions [C2]. These questions are specifically constrained to require an understanding of the entire corpus"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.623, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 32, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:54.749Z", "t_ms": 8575, "delta": " while avoiding the retrieval of specific low-level facts [C2].\n\nThe questions from all combinations are gathered, resulting in a benchmark"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 8.835, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 33, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:54.960Z", "t_ms": 8786, "delta": " set of $K \\times N \\times M$ global questions per dataset [C2]. For their primary evaluation, the authors configured"}}
{"event": "token", "client_s": 9.027, "data": {"request_id": "cffdef589e8e", "seq": 34, "ts": "2026-10-28T07:11:55.153Z", "t_ms": 8979, "delta": " $K = N = M = 5$, producing a total of 125 test questions per dataset [C2]."}}
